{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grow Harvest Repeat</strong> is a  2D farming game where you build your farming empire. Take care of your garden, level up skills, and unlock new areas as you progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488760/extras/1_Grow.gif?t=1744807154\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Earn by growing plants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every farming empire starts in the garden\u00a0\u2014 and so does yours. Buy seeds, grow crops, and sell yields - it helps you to get the first coins and will improve your skill. The better your farming skills, the more you can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488760/extras/2_Craft.gif?t=1744807154\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft goods for sale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why sell vegetables if you can make more profit selling vegetable salad? Build different devices for crafting. Sell ground coffee,  grilled corn, cheese, and much more.\u00a0The better your crafting skills, the more profitable goods you can make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488760/extras/3_Animals.gif?t=1744807154\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build barns and buy animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you become an experienced farmer, it's time to invest in livestock. Cows and chickens will bring you milk and eggs. When life gives you milk and eggs, make bread.  And sell it, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is in Early Access, with more features coming soon! Your feedback will help us shape and improve the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cornucopia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488760/a1f5307eecbc9d15316b32a30bec93a9b06e7a6d.jpg"},{"name":"Experienced farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488760/da7b7c4ff17a331f22a7f4212bdc1c7dc7a83e24.jpg"},{"name":"Craftsman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488760/1297aae45f77d55d47f474683db036d75319f932.jpg"},{"name":"Start-up capital","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488760/ff69dc920659fde53c75269e93a42c3fbf0c93c7.jpg"},{"name":"Heavy industry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488760/b4a865f2d41d7ac4c95f69984747ada3adacbbcb.jpg"},{"name":"Quality of life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488760/ebf3d1a227dc70531bc223ee8b2f253895c8a5dd.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488760?t=1744807154","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488760?t=1744807154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488760/e3512adc6d379c62de72da1beb88cd2d77cb3a88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744807154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488760/e3512adc6d379c62de72da1beb88cd2d77cb3a88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744807154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grow Harvest Repeat</strong> is a  2D farming game where you build your farming empire. Take care of your garden, level up skills, and unlock new areas as you progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488760/extras/1_Grow.gif?t=1744807154\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Earn by growing plants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every farming empire starts in the garden\u00a0\u2014 and so does yours. Buy seeds, grow crops, and sell yields - it helps you to get the first coins and will improve your skill. The better your farming skills, the more you can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488760/extras/2_Craft.gif?t=1744807154\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft goods for sale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why sell vegetables if you can make more profit selling vegetable salad? Build different devices for crafting. Sell ground coffee,  grilled corn, cheese, and much more.\u00a0The better your crafting skills, the more profitable goods you can make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488760/extras/3_Animals.gif?t=1744807154\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build barns and buy animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you become an experienced farmer, it's time to invest in livestock. Cows and chickens will bring you milk and eggs. When life gives you milk and eggs, make bread.  And sell it, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is in Early Access, with more features coming soon! Your feedback will help us shape and improve the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragra